#################################################################
# Portfolio Knowledge Graph — Protégé viewing bundle
#
# GENERATED FILE — not the authoritative source. Produced by
# flattening tbox.ttl + reference.ttl + rules.ttl + instances.trig
# into one plain-Turtle graph, because Protégé has no concept of
# named graphs/quads and cannot open .trig files at all: pointed at
# instances.trig directly, it either refuses to parse or silently
# collapses every named graph into one, destroying the very
# transaction-time partitioning schema/instances.trig exists to
# demonstrate (see 07-ontology-topology.md).
#
# To keep that information visible anyway, every individual that
# came from a named graph in instances.trig is tagged here with
# :sourceNamedGraph, an annotation property that exists ONLY in
# this file — it is not part of the ontology itself. Use Protégé's
# "Individuals by class" / OntoGraf views, then check an
# individual's Annotations tab for :sourceNamedGraph to see which
# ingestion batch (quarterly universe snapshot, daily agent run,
# EDGAR restatement, entity-resolution output, orchestrator
# decision...) it belongs to — a reasonable approximation of the
# real topology given the tool's single-graph limitation, not a
# substitute for it. For the real, load-bearing multi-graph
# structure, load instances.trig into GraphDB/Fuseki, or query it
# directly with rdflib's Dataset (see schema/README.md).
#
# DO NOT edit this file directly — regenerate it from the source
# files instead (tbox.ttl, reference.ttl, rules.ttl, instances.trig
# are the ones under version control conceptually; this is a build
# artifact of those four, checked in for convenience).
#################################################################

@prefix : <https://thesis.local/kg/portfolio#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

: a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Portfolio Knowledge Graph — Protégé viewing bundle (TBox + reference + rules + flattened instances)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Ontology for a temporal, audit-traceable knowledge graph backing an S&P 500 portfolio construction/maintenance system. This bundle flattens the multi-graph implementation into one graph for Protégé; see schema/README.md for the real named-graph layout." ;
    owl:versionInfo "0.3.0-thesis-implementation-protege-view" .

